(1266563, 162172, 31042, '<td valign="top">This is a very bizzare challenge, but I feel you''ve came up with a brilliant way to make this list of mandatory components in the photo useable and creative. I think however it would''ve been better if you''d make the duck face forward.  Very Very Creative.  Im not going to give you a ten, because the photo isn''t very visually appealing, (well it is, but the whole challenge isn;t that great), but i will rate this photo the best out of all of them.<br/> <br/>Well Done!</td>', 'This is a very bizzare challenge, but I feel you''ve came up with a brilliant way to make this list of mandatory components in the photo useable and creative. I think however it would''ve been better if you''d make the duck face forward.  Very Very Creative.  Im not going to give you a ten, because the photo isn''t very visually appealing, (well it is, but the whole challenge isn;t that great), but i will rate this photo the best out of all of them. Well Done!', '2005-04-02 20:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
