(1266627, 162035, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good job integrating the elements into a coherent scene.The white balance seems off, and the composition is bottom-heavy, but this is one of the few shots where grapes and a rubber ducky co-exist in a scene that makes sense.</td>', 'Good job integrating the elements into a coherent scene.The white balance seems off, and the composition is bottom-heavy, but this is one of the few shots where grapes and a rubber ducky co-exist in a scene that makes sense.', '2005-04-02 20:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
