(1267091, 162068, 35448, '<td valign="top">I guess the duck is placed directly behind the glass to get those vertically flipped duck heads in the glass. That''s a nice effect, but took a while for me to discover when looking at the picture. The immediate impression was that the duck is disturbingly hiding behind the glass and thus everything in the scene is too tightly packed into the center. Otherwise this is excellent - very nice background and lighting.</td>', 'I guess the duck is placed directly behind the glass to get those vertically flipped duck heads in the glass. That''s a nice effect, but took a while for me to discover when looking at the picture. The immediate impression was that the duck is disturbingly hiding behind the glass and thus everything in the scene is too tightly packed into the center. Otherwise this is excellent - very nice background and lighting.', '2005-04-03 09:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
