(1271818, 161861, 34741, '<td valign="top">good.. could be better wif the grapes were not so organised.. they attract a lot of attention due to their fine lineup.</td>', 'good.. could be better wif the grapes were not so organised.. they attract a lot of attention due to their fine lineup.', '2005-04-05 04:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
