(1271851, 161960, 34741, '<td valign="top">wonderful imagination. Hurrah for you</td>', 'wonderful imagination. Hurrah for you', '2005-04-05 05:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271853, 161940, 34741, '<td valign="top">reduce the number of grapes adn you will see the ffect for yourself</td>', 'reduce the number of grapes adn you will see the ffect for yourself', '2005-04-05 05:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271855, 162121, 34741, '<td valign="top">pic is great but ducky looks more like the ugly duckling grown old.</td>', 'pic is great but ducky looks more like the ugly duckling grown old.', '2005-04-05 05:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271857, 161930, 34741, '<td valign="top">excellent work.. but how abot a few waves??</td>', 'excellent work.. but how abot a few waves??', '2005-04-05 05:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271859, 162165, 34741, '<td valign="top">too much shine has dominated the excellent first look.</td>', 'too much shine has dominated the excellent first look.', '2005-04-05 05:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271869, 162018, 27845, '<td valign="top">The lights come out nice, it''s even visible you had a high aperture. The duck might be more yellow, it''s a bit green-ish. 5.</td>', 'The lights come out nice, it''s even visible you had a high aperture. The duck might be more yellow, it''s a bit green-ish. 5.', '2005-04-05 06:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271870, 162147, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice deco-work. I like the bokeh effect on the background. The composition is too static though. 6.</td>', 'Nice deco-work. I like the bokeh effect on the background. The composition is too static though. 6.', '2005-04-05 06:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271872, 162046, 27845, '<td valign="top">You''ve got strange grapes! Your ducky seems to be out of focus in the head. The cloth is cool though. 6.</td>', 'You''ve got strange grapes! Your ducky seems to be out of focus in the head. The cloth is cool though. 6.', '2005-04-05 06:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271873, 162066, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Creative. The background might be brighter. The glass in the water gives it a nice touch. 7.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Creative. The background might be brighter. The glass in the water gives it a nice touch. 7.', '2005-04-05 06:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271874, 161962, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool ducky! Good close up, as far as I can see, everything is in focus. Some smoke would have been cool, showing the duck''s anger. 8.</td>', 'Cool ducky! Good close up, as far as I can see, everything is in focus. Some smoke would have been cool, showing the duck''s anger. 8.', '2005-04-05 06:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271876, 162035, 27845, '<td valign="top">You had a good idea, but I''m not too fond of the execution. Your picture is quite noisy, some more light would have been good. Also, the ducky is very small. 5.</td>', 'You had a good idea, but I''m not too fond of the execution. Your picture is quite noisy, some more light would have been good. Also, the ducky is very small. 5.', '2005-04-05 06:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271877, 161934, 27845, '<td valign="top">Sweet. I like the light-refractions from the vase. Some little stones or shells or sth would have been good in the vase. 6.</td>', 'Sweet. I like the light-refractions from the vase. Some little stones or shells or sth would have been good in the vase. 6.', '2005-04-05 06:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271879, 161990, 27845, '<td valign="top">The grapes are too dark. They looke like olives. The duck''s face needs some more light as well. 5.</td>', 'The grapes are too dark. They looke like olives. The duck''s face needs some more light as well. 5.', '2005-04-05 06:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271880, 162028, 27845, '<td valign="top">Lots of noise here. And what''s that background? I can''t recognize anyhing in it and find it rather distracting. 4.</td>', 'Lots of noise here. And what''s that background? I can''t recognize anyhing in it and find it rather distracting. 4.', '2005-04-05 06:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271882, 162156, 27845, '<td valign="top">Lol. Nice setup. The only thing I don''t like is the plastic background, the light reflections are ugly. 7.</td>', 'Lol. Nice setup. The only thing I don''t like is the plastic background, the light reflections are ugly. 7.', '2005-04-05 06:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271883, 162060, 27845, '<td valign="top">Sharp, good lighting, nice composition, vibrant colours and creative. Good job. 8.</td>', 'Sharp, good lighting, nice composition, vibrant colours and creative. Good job. 8.', '2005-04-05 06:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271885, 162190, 27845, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I think you messed up the lighting. The cat''s blown out on top, and your background looks worn-out in the upper part. 5.</td>', 'Good idea, but I think you messed up the lighting. The cat''s blown out on top, and your background looks worn-out in the upper part. 5.', '2005-04-05 06:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271886, 162195, 27845, '<td valign="top">Having fun, were you? I like your idea. Did you actually freeze the ducky or is it some kind of plastic or glue? Ohm those little tools are great. The grapes look as if they didn''t really know what to do with the duck :) 8.</td>', 'Having fun, were you? I like your idea. Did you actually freeze the ducky or is it some kind of plastic or glue? Ohm those little tools are great. The grapes look as if they didn''t really know what to do with the duck :) 8.', '2005-04-05 06:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271887, 162025, 27845, '<td valign="top">You got everything the challenge needs, but I think your shot''s not that creative. 6.</td>', 'You got everything the challenge needs, but I think your shot''s not that creative. 6.', '2005-04-05 06:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271890, 161836, 27845, '<td valign="top">Huh? Strange title. Viticulture is wine-growing, right? I can''t see any halos though. And I don''t know what poultry means. For the picture, I don''t like it that much. The ducky looks strange, as if it was melting. Your shot looks underexposed. 4.</td>', 'Huh? Strange title. Viticulture is wine-growing, right? I can''t see any halos though. And I don''t know what poultry means. For the picture, I don''t like it that much. The ducky looks strange, as if it was melting. Your shot looks underexposed. 4.', '2005-04-05 06:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271891, 162126, 27845, '<td valign="top">Good idea to make the ducky eat one of the grapes. Your shot looks oversharpened though, there''s a halo around the ducky. 6.</td>', 'Good idea to make the ducky eat one of the grapes. Your shot looks oversharpened though, there''s a halo around the ducky. 6.', '2005-04-05 06:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271893, 162204, 27845, '<td valign="top">Too dark for me. You could have created mystery by other means. How about having the grapes hover over the ground? 3.</td>', 'Too dark for me. You could have created mystery by other means. How about having the grapes hover over the ground? 3.', '2005-04-05 06:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271894, 162068, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''d have put the duck in front of the glass. I like the foam. 6.</td>', 'I''d have put the duck in front of the glass. I like the foam. 6.', '2005-04-05 06:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271896, 162125, 27845, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit boring. Maybe that''s only because I''ve seen so many duck shots. There''s nothing here that would make you stand out a bit. 5.</td>', 'Looks a bit boring. Maybe that''s only because I''ve seen so many duck shots. There''s nothing here that would make you stand out a bit. 5.', '2005-04-05 06:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271897, 162198, 27845, '<td valign="top">They''re not that trocken anymore :) I don''t like the composition that much. 5.</td>', 'They''re not that trocken anymore :) I don''t like the composition that much. 5.', '2005-04-05 06:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271898, 162164, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your model has a disturbingly fanatic look. Maybe that''s just me. Good idea, bad composition. Too much empty space in the upper right, and the duck is too small. You might have moved the duck closer to the boy''s face. 5.</td>', 'Your model has a disturbingly fanatic look. Maybe that''s just me. Good idea, bad composition. Too much empty space in the upper right, and the duck is too small. You might have moved the duck closer to the boy''s face. 5.', '2005-04-05 06:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271899, 162024, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wohoo! How did you get that close to the stage? Whenever I try to take close-ups of Rubber "Rub Me" Ducky security messes things up. Btw, they''re touring through Europe next year :) 8.</td>', 'Wohoo! How did you get that close to the stage? Whenever I try to take close-ups of Rubber "Rub Me" Ducky security messes things up. Btw, they''re touring through Europe next year :) 8.', '2005-04-05 06:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271900, 162090, 27845, '<td valign="top">Contrast! Contrast! And colour balance! 5.</td>', 'Contrast! Contrast! And colour balance! 5.', '2005-04-05 06:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271901, 161957, 27845, '<td valign="top">Yeah, that''s creative. The title is chosen well. I''d have made the border a bit broader or left it all away though. 8.</td>', 'Yeah, that''s creative. The title is chosen well. I''d have made the border a bit broader or left it all away though. 8.', '2005-04-05 06:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271902, 161865, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like your blue. Less droplets in front of the ducky would have been better. 6.</td>', 'I like your blue. Less droplets in front of the ducky would have been better. 6.', '2005-04-05 06:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271903, 162079, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice, reflection, good composition, but not that creative. 7.</td>', 'Nice, reflection, good composition, but not that creative. 7.', '2005-04-05 06:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271904, 162148, 27845, '<td valign="top">Too dark for my taste. There are some ugly light glares on the ducky''s head. 5.</td>', 'Too dark for my taste. There are some ugly light glares on the ducky''s head. 5.', '2005-04-05 06:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271906, 161961, 27845, '<td valign="top">You''ve got bad jpeg artifacts in your shot. I''d say less compression would still have kept your image below 150kb. 6.</td>', 'You''ve got bad jpeg artifacts in your shot. I''d say less compression would still have kept your image below 150kb. 6.', '2005-04-05 06:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271908, 161968, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your focus should be on the ducky rather than on the candle. Also, your ducky is too dark. 4.</td>', 'Your focus should be on the ducky rather than on the candle. Also, your ducky is too dark. 4.', '2005-04-05 06:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
