(1273041, 162172, 35645, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but something strikes me as odd... can''t quite put my finger on it ... wait... the seagulls aren''t eating the grapes! ;-) Love the lighting for this, and I love the composition. Great details in the water and sand.</td>', 'I like this photo, but something strikes me as odd... can''t quite put my finger on it ... wait... the seagulls aren''t eating the grapes! ;-) Love the lighting for this, and I love the composition. Great details in the water and sand.', '2005-04-05 21:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273042, 162178, 35645, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for this one. Feels like you''re trying a bit too hard for the effects you''re getting. Interesting idea with the grapes, tho, and an original treatment.</td>', 'I don''t really care for this one. Feels like you''re trying a bit too hard for the effects you''re getting. Interesting idea with the grapes, tho, and an original treatment.', '2005-04-05 21:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
