(1274093, 162175, 25946, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfully simple shot.  The focus is right on and I love the creative way you did your lighting. (9)</td>', 'What a wonderfully simple shot.  The focus is right on and I love the creative way you did your lighting. (9)', '2005-04-06 06:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1274097, 162068, 25946, '<td valign="top">I think this is a wonderfully creative shot.  I love the bubbles.  The lighting is great and I do like the nice reflections of color in the stir stick and the glass.  It does make you want to move the glass over just a bit so you can see more of the duckie''s face, but then it may lose some of it''s appeal.  Great shot and I really like it.  (9)</td>', 'I think this is a wonderfully creative shot.  I love the bubbles.  The lighting is great and I do like the nice reflections of color in the stir stick and the glass.  It does make you want to move the glass over just a bit so you can see more of the duckie''s face, but then it may lose some of it''s appeal.  Great shot and I really like it.  (9)', '2005-04-06 06:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1274100, 161957, 25946, '<td valign="top">So cute.  Amazing how creative this is.  Love the babie grape duckies.  It made me laugh.  Excellent job</td>', 'So cute.  Amazing how creative this is.  Love the babie grape duckies.  It made me laugh.  Excellent job', '2005-04-06 06:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1274103, 161973, 25946, '<td valign="top">Not your typical yellow duckie.  I like it!!  Very simple, great lighting and use of all items needed for the challenge.  Good luck!!</td>', 'Not your typical yellow duckie.  I like it!!  Very simple, great lighting and use of all items needed for the challenge.  Good luck!!', '2005-04-06 06:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
