(1275688, 162190, 35357, '<td valign="top">Very funny... I mean, nice juxtaposition of good versus evil.  Maybe NeatImage would help the grainy background.  bump to [10]</td>', 'Very funny... I mean, nice juxtaposition of good versus evil.  Maybe NeatImage would help the grainy background.  bump to [10]', '2005-04-06 18:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
