(1275932, 162096, 33736, '<td valign="top">This one is hysterical - You should get a special ribbon just for reading the rules!  Even the second form of water shows your attention to detail.</td>', 'This one is hysterical - You should get a special ribbon just for reading the rules!  Even the second form of water shows your attention to detail.', '2005-04-06 20:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1275956, 161846, 33736, '<td valign="top">Water isn''t apparent enough (if present at all), although it might be in tiny droplets throughout the grass.  Otherwise,  I like the swirl of the grasses.  Ducky could be have been tilted a little more forward.  I''m nitpicking because I do like the picture so much (hated to see it fall short.)</td>', 'Water isn''t apparent enough (if present at all), although it might be in tiny droplets throughout the grass.  Otherwise,  I like the swirl of the grasses.  Ducky could be have been tilted a little more forward.  I''m nitpicking because I do like the picture so much (hated to see it fall short.)', '2005-04-06 20:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1275965, 162119, 33736, '<td valign="top">Nice job on capturing the bubbles and foam.  I can feel the "popping quality" of different sections.</td>', 'Nice job on capturing the bubbles and foam.  I can feel the "popping quality" of different sections.', '2005-04-06 20:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
