(1276019, 162098, 33736, '<td valign="top">Nope, just a little interest-creating composition.  Actually, pretty cute, but needed more of a sense a check-off list - or something, anything!</td>', 'Nope, just a little interest-creating composition.  Actually, pretty cute, but needed more of a sense a check-off list - or something, anything!', '2005-04-06 21:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
