(1276047, 161838, 33736, '<td valign="top">How could this duck possibly drown?  Maybe, could have been face down in the glass (duck tail up!)   But, I did wonder if it''s daddy was a Split-Peacock.  The lighting and color of the grapes are wonderful.</td>', 'How could this duck possibly drown?  Maybe, could have been face down in the glass (duck tail up!)   But, I did wonder if it''s daddy was a Split-Peacock.  The lighting and color of the grapes are wonderful.', '2005-04-06 21:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
