(1278342, 162154, 33736, '<td valign="top">Who would have thought that a rubber ducky could evoke an aura of romance, but you managed to pull one of the only two 10''s I rated in this challenge.  And oddly, enough both were Romance personified.</td>', 'Who would have thought that a rubber ducky could evoke an aura of romance, but you managed to pull one of the only two 10''s I rated in this challenge.  And oddly, enough both were Romance personified.', '2005-04-08 00:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278350, 162090, 33736, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the color choices here, but your selection of the lighting sources is very clever.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the color choices here, but your selection of the lighting sources is very clever.', '2005-04-08 00:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278359, 161854, 33736, '<td valign="top">Silly, but compelling.  The colors of the plastic grapes and leaves look a bit flat.</td>', 'Silly, but compelling.  The colors of the plastic grapes and leaves look a bit flat.', '2005-04-08 00:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278371, 162166, 33736, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, composition, cropping, use of water and other props, lighting, and clarity.  Wow, I just talked myself into raising my original rating from a 7 to a 9.</td>', 'Nice colors, composition, cropping, use of water and other props, lighting, and clarity.  Wow, I just talked myself into raising my original rating from a 7 to a 9.', '2005-04-08 00:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278379, 162076, 33736, '<td valign="top">Each set of colors holds it''s own in this picture - really pretty.  The positioning of the flowers is what makes this one work.</td>', 'Each set of colors holds it''s own in this picture - really pretty.  The positioning of the flowers is what makes this one work.', '2005-04-08 00:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278385, 162152, 33736, '<td valign="top">I''m not enamoured of the colors, but you surely do know how to work the lights!</td>', 'I''m not enamoured of the colors, but you surely do know how to work the lights!', '2005-04-08 00:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278399, 161986, 33736, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast between the dark and light.   But the use of a frame (or whatever the white box is) emphasizes the slightly "off" feeling of the grapes'' path and the bowl edge.</td>', 'Love the contrast between the dark and light.   But the use of a frame (or whatever the white box is) emphasizes the slightly "off" feeling of the grapes'' path and the bowl edge.', '2005-04-08 00:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278402, 162044, 33736, '<td valign="top">I really LOVE being bathed in patterns from outside light sources.  This is a terrific picture that met the challenge and the title.    The back line of the fabric is a little distracting, but over all, this one gets a rare 10 from me.</td>', 'I really LOVE being bathed in patterns from outside light sources.  This is a terrific picture that met the challenge and the title.    The back line of the fabric is a little distracting, but over all, this one gets a rare 10 from me.', '2005-04-08 00:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278413, 162091, 33736, '<td valign="top">The colors are flat, the images are slightly off, and the design isn''t overly exciting.  But, I do love your capture of the water bubbles.</td>', 'The colors are flat, the images are slightly off, and the design isn''t overly exciting.  But, I do love your capture of the water bubbles.', '2005-04-08 00:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278444, 162111, 33736, '<td valign="top">A bit fuzzy, a bit off-kilter, flat color on the grapes, and I would rather have seen a green umbrella.  But - the swirl of the fabric, which catches the lighting in a wonderful shimmery way and the swirls of the liquid in the glass, which you caught well are terrific.  However, what really won me to this picture is that one drop of water just in front of the duck.  I keep reaching out to wipe it up, before catching myself.  That is a serindipitous capture on your side.</td>', 'A bit fuzzy, a bit off-kilter, flat color on the grapes, and I would rather have seen a green umbrella.  But - the swirl of the fabric, which catches the lighting in a wonderful shimmery way and the swirls of the liquid in the glass, which you caught well are terrific.  However, what really won me to this picture is that one drop of water just in front of the duck.  I keep reaching out to wipe it up, before catching myself.  That is a serindipitous capture on your side.', '2005-04-08 00:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278464, 162162, 33615, '<td valign="top">nicely done in a quacky sort of way.  :o)</td>', 'nicely done in a quacky sort of way.  :o)', '2005-04-08 00:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278466, 161956, 33736, '<td valign="top">Shooting a tree from an unusual angle - looking straight up or slightly off -  can add interest and vitality to a photograph.  Such an image might spark a desire in the viewer to lie down on the ground to study the leafy bowers high above, or suggest a mid-afternoon dreaming session.   This odd angle adds little meaning or inspiration to the picture.   I would suggest to you and others who use this technique to keep it rare - and thus valuable.</td>', 'Shooting a tree from an unusual angle - looking straight up or slightly off -  can add interest and vitality to a photograph.  Such an image might spark a desire in the viewer to lie down on the ground to study the leafy bowers high above, or suggest a mid-afternoon dreaming session.   This odd angle adds little meaning or inspiration to the picture.   I would suggest to you and others who use this technique to keep it rare - and thus valuable.', '2005-04-08 00:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278469, 161956, 33615, '<td valign="top">Tough challenge - I think you have something here.</td>', 'Tough challenge - I think you have something here.', '2005-04-08 00:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
