(1280272, 161866, 25946, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  I just loved this one..  Glad to see that it took first.  It was such a cute entry..  :)</td>', 'Congratulations.  I just loved this one..  Glad to see that it took first.  It was such a cute entry..  :)', '2005-04-09 01:21:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1280275, 162080, 93, '<td valign="top">Hehehe.. I''m glad a lot of people found this as funny and creative as I did.<br/> <br/>As for that unidentifiable brown thing in the foreground? It''s supposed to be some sort of "rock bowl" to hold the water in.. but the water turned out to be invisible in it *ANYWAY*.. but it''s there.<br/> <br/>*le sigh*.. I couldn''t find *anything* else around the house that made a better prop..</td>', 'Hehehe.. I''m glad a lot of people found this as funny and creative as I did. As for that unidentifiable brown thing in the foreground? It''s supposed to be some sort of "rock bowl" to hold the water in.. but the water turned out to be invisible in it *ANYWAY*.. but it''s there. *le sigh*.. I couldn''t find *anything* else around the house that made a better prop..', '2005-04-09 01:22:44.000000', NULL, 0),
