(1280474, 162201, 27845, '<td valign="top">I must confess I nominated you for DQ. It seemed to me that you had applied selective gaussian blur, because part of the background close to the neck is sharp, whereas the rest is blurry. Where does that effect come from?</td>', 'I must confess I nominated you for DQ. It seemed to me that you had applied selective gaussian blur, because part of the background close to the neck is sharp, whereas the rest is blurry. Where does that effect come from?', '2005-04-09 06:12:58.000000', NULL, 0),
