(1280504, 162054, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really thought this would have placed higher.  I gave you a 7 - shows what I know.  Contrary to what people believe here, sometimes an image works great when it ''appears'' snapshotish (their term, not mine).  Like what you did with the grapes!  You have entirely too much time... :)</td>', 'I really thought this would have placed higher.  I gave you a 7 - shows what I know.  Contrary to what people believe here, sometimes an image works great when it ''appears'' snapshotish (their term, not mine).  Like what you did with the grapes!  You have entirely too much time... :)', '2005-04-09 07:45:10.000000', NULL, 0),
