(1280520, 161957, 7234, '<td valign="top">well i think this one was the most creative usage of the grapes. I was expecting it to do higher but i guess the technical quality let it down. great idea with the grapes but the towel doesn''t work. if this was set up better it could have been the winner or at least one of the first three.</td>', 'well i think this one was the most creative usage of the grapes. I was expecting it to do higher but i guess the technical quality let it down. great idea with the grapes but the towel doesn''t work. if this was set up better it could have been the winner or at least one of the first three.', '2005-04-09 08:34:57.000000', NULL, 0),
