(1280570, 162051, 8624, '<td valign="top">I gave this one an 8 - I thought your concept was good and this is a strong rechnical photo with nice composition and sharpness. I particularly liked the use of the grapes as little bouys and the string as nautical rope between them.</td>', 'I gave this one an 8 - I thought your concept was good and this is a strong rechnical photo with nice composition and sharpness. I particularly liked the use of the grapes as little bouys and the string as nautical rope between them.', '2005-04-09 10:10:23.000000', NULL, 0),
