(1280955, 161866, 27137, '<td valign="top">Hey this is great!<br/>Thank you all for your comments<br/>I never thought i would get a blue R<br/>Last i have been busy exploring portraits this challenge was a nice way to get away from something that i find difficult (portraits), i guess i like working with plastic duckies better :)<br/> <br/>thanks<br/>pano<br/></td>', 'Hey this is great!Thank you all for your commentsI never thought i would get a blue RLast i have been busy exploring portraits this challenge was a nice way to get away from something that i find difficult (portraits), i guess i like working with plastic duckies better :) thankspano', '2005-04-09 16:21:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1280981, 161866, 33520, '<td valign="top">No favs so far!!! Hm I am confused...<br/>ps I ''ve added it to my favs :)</td>', 'No favs so far!!! Hm I am confused...ps I ''ve added it to my favs :)', '2005-04-09 16:57:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1281134, 162172, 9668, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your votes and comments! I find it interesting that this image would almost score as high as some other shots that I prize much higher (it beat out <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=72085" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">''Cannon Beach''</a> and was a short ways from beating out <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=148976" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">''Adrift''</a>). But I guess that is the nature of the website, that the photo is creative, and meets the crazy challenge rules. In my own opinion, this isn''t <b>that</b> great of a shot, it is just alot different from other shots in the challenge.<br/> <br/>As far as setting up and taking it, the hardest part wasn''t the shoot, it was probably my dad having to go and get everything. The photoshoot only lasted 5 minutes. I took 23 images in that time, only 7 with the flash on, and only one of those only had five grapes. I think this is one of the craziest shoots I''ve been on, and it was a ton of fun to do.</td>', 'Thanks for all your votes and comments! I find it interesting that this image would almost score as high as some other shots that I prize much higher (it beat out ''Cannon Beach'' and was a short ways from beating out ''Adrift''). But I guess that is the nature of the website, that the photo is creative, and meets the crazy challenge rules. In my own opinion, this isn''t that great of a shot, it is just alot different from other shots in the challenge. As far as setting up and taking it, the hardest part wasn''t the shoot, it was probably my dad having to go and get everything. The photoshoot only lasted 5 minutes. I took 23 images in that time, only 7 with the flash on, and only one of those only had five grapes. I think this is one of the craziest shoots I''ve been on, and it was a ton of fun to do.', '2005-04-09 19:00:56.000000', NULL, 0),
