(1282975, 162152, 20925, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot during the challenge but a couple of elements didn''t work for me.  While I liked the lighting and the glow from under the duck/water, the out of focus/flarey nature of the bottom blue frame was distracting for me.  I liked your choice for DoF but found the actual focal point hard to find because of the smooth surfaces -- the red might have been the culprit here, maybe the duck head just seems fuzzy to me because of the lighting.  I didn''t love the crop or the composition - centered shot, duck centered in bowl/frame.<br/> <br/>I voted this a five - a pretty high score for this challenge from me.</td>', 'I liked this shot during the challenge but a couple of elements didn''t work for me.  While I liked the lighting and the glow from under the duck/water, the out of focus/flarey nature of the bottom blue frame was distracting for me.  I liked your choice for DoF but found the actual focal point hard to find because of the smooth surfaces -- the red might have been the culprit here, maybe the duck head just seems fuzzy to me because of the lighting.  I didn''t love the crop or the composition - centered shot, duck centered in bowl/frame. I voted this a five - a pretty high score for this challenge from me.', '2005-04-11 00:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
