(1481746, 162124, 16488, '<td valign="top">A clever set up!  But, I''m afraid, I was one of your 109 (impressive!) no. 5''s.  The two things that killed it for me were the blown highlights and the out of focus grapes--probably that and the fact that there were so many clever duckies...<br/> <br/>I know you''re a great people photographer!  Studio is just another direction to stretch.<br/> <br/>(and take heart, you could have a duckie sitting firmly in your top-scoring place...like me)</td>', 'A clever set up!  But, I''m afraid, I was one of your 109 (impressive!) no. 5''s.  The two things that killed it for me were the blown highlights and the out of focus grapes--probably that and the fact that there were so many clever duckies... I know you''re a great people photographer!  Studio is just another direction to stretch. (and take heart, you could have a duckie sitting firmly in your top-scoring place...like me)', '2005-06-24 17:53:04.000000', NULL, 0),
